WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.972
Module 11 gave us the Pandas tools we need to transform, group, reshape, and validate tables.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:13.092
In this module, we use those tools for a more practical purpose:

00:00:13.092 --> 00:00:19.277
improving data quality and understanding the dataset before formal analysis.

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:23.212
Think of the process as a sequence.

00:00:23.212 --> 00:00:25.987
First, we inspect the data.

00:00:25.987 --> 00:00:32.132
Then we identify problems. Next, we make careful cleaning decisions.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:38.487
Finally, we explore the cleaned data to understand distributions and group differences.

00:00:38.964 --> 00:00:42.996
The important point is that cleaning and EDA are connected.

00:00:42.996 --> 00:00:47.951
If categories are inconsistent, your group summaries may be wrong.

00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:52.396
If duplicate rows remain, your totals may be inflated.

00:00:52.396 --> 00:01:00.051
If numeric values are stored as text, calculations may fail or produce misleading results.

00:01:00.051 --> 00:01:08.096
This module also prepares us for Module 13, where we will use statistics and visualization on data that we have already

00:01:08.096 --> 00:01:10.620
inspected and cleaned.
